  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "328期封面作品-參加「咱是台灣人」遊行"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-gD27bIz-tv8gWeUmPj7-DdQ-sbO8n33hdeufF3KdKNWi8jbon4J9BhbA1Io3T1u5mn8ChTut4rK8NS-xsZiDZiG8-nSDblFYVZut-vPdnWONdUaintvmsLBDQyJTPWXd7K71kmko94rD/s2048/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258A%25E9%2581%258A%25E8%25A1%258C.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1435\" data-original-width=\"2048\" height=\"448\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-gD27bIz-tv8gWeUmPj7-DdQ-sbO8n33hdeufF3KdKNWi8jbon4J9BhbA1Io3T1u5mn8ChTut4rK8NS-xsZiDZiG8-nSDblFYVZut-vPdnWONdUaintvmsLBDQyJTPWXd7K71kmko94rD/w640-h448/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258A%25E9%2581%258A%25E8%25A1%258C.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><p></p><p><b>作品名稱</b></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">參加「咱是台灣人」遊行</span></p><div><br /></div><p><b>相片簡介：</b></p><p><b><br /></b></p><p>1995年8月20，台北、台中、台南、高雄四个所在同時舉行「咱是台灣人」大遊行，計共有兩萬外人參加，《台文通訊》台灣總聯絡處mā招有志牽「講台語、寫台文～台文通訊」布條仔參與。</p><p><br /></p><p>Hip相--ê：陳豐惠，1992年底開始做《台文通訊》台灣總聯絡處ê專職工作者，自án-ne m̄-bat脫離台語文ê路。</p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報328期，2021年7月出刊。</b></span></div><div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEizf61ddAEbQMkvrNtnThm_Nh0OzzHHhAYxpxKbW6c0cBtHCnNxF_112Z1rIeDA-gKmgWL3gTMDqhvJjlzys99R2lf0D3aPhraHyLcsYbNDQv-qyn8FqQd5Ip5jvfvviedQkVmB_D-OCIHg/s1424/328%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEizf61ddAEbQMkvrNtnThm_Nh0OzzHHhAYxpxKbW6c0cBtHCnNxF_112Z1rIeDA-gKmgWL3gTMDqhvJjlzys99R2lf0D3aPhraHyLcsYbNDQv-qyn8FqQd5Ip5jvfvviedQkVmB_D-OCIHg/w281-h400/328%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"281\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><b><br /></b></div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　</b></span></div><div><b><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></b></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\"><b>線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5